# Third-party CrisisMMD photos (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, Alam et al. 2018) are
# fetched by data_public_crisismmd/download_dataset.py, not redistributed
# in this repo -- too large (~650MB) and not ours to republish. The code
# to regenerate them, and the resulting text/label metadata and analysis
# results, are committed as normal.
data_public_crisismmd/images/
data_public_crisismmd/images_degraded/

# Same reasoning for MM-IMDb (Arevalo et al. 2017): raw/ is the ~8.7GB
# downloaded archive plus its ~17GB extraction (posters + IMDb metadata
# JSON, third-party content, not ours to republish); images_degraded/ is
# generated from it. download_dataset.py and generate_dataset.py
# regenerate both from the public Internet Archive mirror.
data_public_mmimdb/raw/
data_public_mmimdb/images_degraded/
